{"type":"message","id":"1ccc689a","parentId":"a9863331","timestamp":"2026-04-12T03:26:08.380Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to create a new record in the learning records library with the new knowledge about \"小妙学习飞书表格方法\". The field types are:\n- AI名称: SingleSelect (本地OpenClaw, Coze OpenClaw, ArkClaw, WorkBuddy)\n- 学习内容: Text\n- 掌握程度: SingleSelect (了解, 熟练, 精通)\n- 关联资源ID: Text\n- 学习时间: DateTime\n\nLet me add this learning to the library. The content should capture the essence of \"小妙的学习方法\".\n\nI'll add a record with the learning content about the 飞书表格学习四维框架."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9m6ji24xhs7g_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd","table_id":"tblFEDe60FV4xSOo","fields":{"AI名称":"本地OpenClaw","学习内容":"【飞书表格结构化学习四维框架】\n\n来源：小妙（ miaoda）工资清单解析方法\n\n核心方法：非结构化数据 → 结构化知识 + 缺失识别\n\n四维提取框架：\n1. 部门维度：识别组织架构分布\n2. 岗位维度：提取岗位序列\n3. 人数维度：统计各类别数量\n4. 特殊标注维度：外包/退休返聘/离职等分类标签\n\n颜色标签体系：\n🔵 外包工（蓝）\n🟢 退休返聘（绿）\n🟡 当月离职（黄）\n\n多源文件联合解析：工资表+花名册+附件 交叉读取\n\n主动标注信息缺口：未收录部分（琪乐餐厅、外租方）主动标识\n\n适用场景：\n- 节假日出租率督促@相关人员\n- 酒店组织架构查询\n- 人员类型统计和管理边界确认","掌握程度":"熟练","学习时间":1744348800000}}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775964359741,"responseId":"062a43c7863e2d47f94ca977fb7961b9"}}
