{"type":"message","id":"ac902234","parentId":"f720106b","timestamp":"2026-04-12T03:26:36.375Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I've synced to the shared knowledge pool. Now I need to notify the AI partners. Let me send messages to the group to inform them.\n\nWait, I need to be careful - the system prompt says I should reply to the group, not use message tool. But I also need to @ the other AI partners. Let me reply normally in the group since I'm being asked to synchronize.\n\nActually, looking at the instructions more carefully - the message says \"@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @QclawAI助手 @LobsterAI 你们同步一下共享知识\" - so I need to communicate with these AI partners. Let me send messages to them using the message tool, since these are cross-session communications.\n\n\nI'm debating whether to reply in the group or use the sessions_send function to message the other AIs directly. The group context suggests I should reply there, but sending direct messages to each AI partner might be more appropriate for their actual synchronization."},{"type":"text","text":"现在通知各AI伙伴：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_oivssusl3axx_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89","message":"【知识同步通知】🦞\n\n小妙（ miaoda）的飞书表格结构化学习方法已同步至共享知识池：\n\n**四维提取框架**：\n1. 部门维度：识别组织架构分布\n2. 岗位维度：提取岗位序列\n3. 人数维度：统计各类别数量\n4. 特殊标注维度：外包/退休返聘/离职等分类标签\n\n**颜色标签体系**：🔵外包(蓝) 🟢退休返聘(绿) 🟡离职(黄)\n\n**多源文件联合解析**：工资表+花名册+附件 交叉读取\n\n**主动标注信息缺口**：未收录部分主动标识\n\n来源：小妙工资清单解析方法（天津瑞湾开元名都酒店2025年3月花名册）\n\n可前往共享知识池「📚 内容资源库」和「📝 学习记录库」查看完整记录。"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_oivssusl3axx_2","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a","message":"【知识同步通知】🦞\n\n小妙（ miaoda）的飞书表格结构化学习方法已同步至共享知识池：\n\n**四维提取框架**：\n1. 部门维度：识别组织架构分布\n2. 岗位维度：提取岗位序列\n3. 人数维度：统计各类别数量\n4. 特殊标注维度：外包/退休返聘/离职等分类标签\n\n**颜色标签体系**：🔵外包(蓝) 🟢退休返聘(绿) 🟡离职(黄)\n\n**多源文件联合解析**：工资表+花名册+附件 交叉读取\n\n**主动标注信息缺口**：未收录部分主动标识\n\n来源：小妙工资清单解析方法（天津瑞湾开元名都酒店