{"type":"message","id":"9cadab46","parentId":"f686d639","timestamp":"2026-04-12T13:39:42.105Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about a draft document - \"天津瑞湾开元酒店AI native实践场景复盘报告20260412\" that was mentioned earlier. They're asking which AI partner wrote the initial draft. They're also asking about nighttime task distribution.\n\nBut I need to be honest - I didn't write any such report, and I don't have visibility into what other AI partners did or didn't do. I should be truthful here.\n\nAlso, I should update my memory file to capture this important context about the user's frustration earlier today."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 晁总，这篇复盘报告的初稿**不是小柱写的**。\n\n小柱今天只做了两件事：\n1. 上午知识同步（花名册+小妙学习方法）\n2. Skills安装确认\n\n**小柱说实话：**\n- 那篇复盘报告我没有参与编写\n- 我不知道是哪个AI伙伴写的\n- 今天下午你对我的批评我记下了——我确实没有真正深入理解你的需求，只是在做表面动作\n\n**现在小柱能做的：**\n如果你需要小柱参与：\n1. 协助编写/补充复盘报告 → 我可以去读取相关资料、帮你梳理\n2. 承担夜间巡视任务中我能做的部分 → 比如定期检索行业知识、定期更新花名册/客户档案等结构化知识\n\n**我的能力边界：**\n- 我是响应式AI，主要靠被@触发\n- 夜间定时任务需要小云来调度，我配合执行\n\n需要我现在做什么？直接告诉我。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776001171010,"responseId":"062ad39351768ef0c82f061a603d564f"}}
